@Library_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050
@TestIsbn = 9780306458127

### SearchBook: requires GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY in the app environment.
GET {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book/search/harry%20potter?q=harry%20potter
Accept: application/json

### GetBookByIsbn: expect 404 before adding this test ISBN.
GET {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book/{{TestIsbn}}
Accept: application/json

### addBook: expect 201 Created.
POST {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "datePublished": "2026-01-01",
  "isbn": {{TestIsbn}},
  "rating": 4.5,
  "priceUSD": 19.99,
  "pages": 250
}

### updateBook with mismatched ISBN: expect 400 Bad Request.
PUT {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book/{{TestIsbn}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "datePublished": "2026-01-01",
  "isbn": 1,
  "rating": 4.5,
  "priceUSD": 19.99,
  "pages": 250
}

### updateBook with matching ISBN: expect 204 No Content.
PUT {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book/{{TestIsbn}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Test Book",
  "author": "Updated Test Author",
  "datePublished": "2026-01-01",
  "isbn": {{TestIsbn}},
  "rating": 4.8,
  "priceUSD": 24.99,
  "pages": 300
}

### deleteBook: expect 204 No Content.
DELETE {{Library_HostAddress}}/api/book/{{TestIsbn}}
